REPORT RAPPORT21 PRINTER W51355D3 +                                             
     SKIP 1 LINESIZE 120 NODATE NOSPREAD NOADJUST                               
                                                                                
SEQUENCE IN-IDDC IN-IDARTNR                                                     
CONTROL FINAL NOPRINT W-IDDC NEWPAGE NOPRINT                                    
                                                                                
