**************************                                                      
                                                                                
REPORT ONDEMAND  PRINTER W51355DD +                                             
   LINESIZE 120 NODATE  NOADJUST NOPAGE PAGESIZE 999                            
                                                                                
SEQUENCE O-IDDC IN-IDARTNR                                                      
CONTROL FINAL NOPRINT O-IDDC NEWPAGE                                            
                                                                                
SUM W-VARDE-UPP   W-VARDE-NED   W-VARDE                                         
                                                                                
TITLE 1 COL   1 'W51355-0'                                          +           
        COL   9 W-IDDC                                              +           
        COL  20 'VCCS'                                              +           
        COL  40 'WEEK REPORT ADJUSTMENTS > 5000 SEK WEEK'           +           
        COL  80 W-AAVV                                              +           
        COL  90 'DC: '                                              +           
        COL  94 O-IDDC                                              +           
        COL 100 'DATE: '                                            +           
        COL 106 W-DATUM                                             +           
                                                                                
TITLE 3 COL 10 'DC ' O-IDDC                                                     
                                                                                
